	(text "SIM routing <=200mm and away from RF/SW; 22R/10pF and 15k follow RM520 reference.\nDisable AT+QSIMDET; keep modem SIM-detect contact 66 open. Sierra open means card present.\nValidate SIM ATR/retry behavior with card present/absent and each profile."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 533.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0754f74b-ebc2-5e79-8610-69f6a7f5212d")
	)
	(text "Default assembly: R2011/12/13/16/17 DNP (Quectel). NEVER feed Quectel pins 24,38,68.\nSierra USB profile: fit all five links; pins 24/38/68 add VCC, 20 selects USB, 22 detects VBUS.\nPin 20 divider is powered by modem VCC; include module pulldown in level verification.\nRESET uses module internal 1.8V pull-up; Q301/Q302 only sink reset/power-off signals.\nAll unused PCIe, coexistence, SIM2, antenna control and configuration contacts float.\nNo host drive before valid rail delay. No mmWave antenna power hardware is captured.\nEvery profile remains on release hold pending current controlled module guide and power envelope."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 335.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1e6ad520-7805-511b-856f-b99e9a008100")
	)
